"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-23"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":25,"name":"1643","type":"restaurant","lat":14.731364,"lng":-61.177416,"location":"Le Carbet","description":"A restaurant in a historic setting at Anse Latouche, serving creative cooking with Creole influences. Listed address: Anse latouche, 97221. Contact: +596 596 78 17 81.","description_fr":"Un restaurant dans le cadre historique de l’Anse Latouche, proposant une cuisine créative aux influences créoles. Adresse indiquée : Anse latouche, 97221. Contact : +596 596 78 17 81.","tags":["Fine Dining"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/1643","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":26,"name":"Agap'' Peyi'' A","type":"restaurant","lat":14.6037175,"lng":-60.940724,"location":"Le François","description":"A table d’hôtes on the heights of Morne Pitault, focused on local flavours and a changing menu. Listed address: Morne Pitault, 97240. Contact: +596 696 96 96 25.","description_fr":"Une table d’hôtes sur les hauteurs du Morne Pitault, consacrée aux saveurs locales et à un menu évolutif. Adresse indiquée : Morne Pitault, 97240. Contact : +596 696 96 96 25.","tags":["Table d’hôtes","Creole"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/bars-restaurants/restaurants/agap-peyi","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":27,"name":"Caribbean Food","type":"restaurant","lat":14.4648074,"lng":-60.928477,"location":"Sainte-Luce","description":"A beach restaurant at Gros Raisin with Creole cooking, seafood and a bar facing the sea. Listed address: plage de gros raisins, 97228. Contact: +596 696 18 26 94.","description_fr":"Un restaurant sur la plage de Gros Raisin,