 696 30 56 56.","tags":["Wellness"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/bien-etre/zenergie","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":85,"name":"Atelier Culinaire De Tatie Maryse","type":"activity","lat":14.66084,"lng":-61.036946,"location":"Saint-Joseph","description":"Cooking workshops focused on Caribbean ingredients and recipes. Check the programme and book a suitable session.","description_fr":"Des ateliers de cuisine autour des ingrédients et recettes antillais. Consultez le programme et réservez une séance adaptée.","tags":["Cooking Class"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/atelier-culinaire-de-tatie-maryse","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":86,"name":"Batterie Sainte Catherine","type":"activity","lat":14.6123175,"lng":-61.098862,"location":"Schœlcher","description":"A historic coastal battery in the Madiana area, a stop for discovering Martinique’s military heritage. Listed address: Quartier Madiana, 97233.","description_fr":"Une batterie côtière historique dans le secteur de Madiana, pour découvrir le patrimoine militaire martiniquais. Adresse indiquée : Quartier Madiana, 97233.","tags":["Heritage","History"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/batterie-sainte-catherine","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":87,"name":"Bèlè An Wout","type":"activity","lat":14.6107752,"lng":-61.066606,"location":"Fort-de-France","description":"An association sharing Martinique’s bèlè music and dance through cultural activities. Listed address: 26, rue théodore baude Crozanville, 97200. Contact: +596 696 35 98 66.","description_fr":"Une association transmettant la musique et la danse bèlè à travers des activités culturelles. Adresse indiquée : 26, rue théodore baude Crozanville, 97200. Contact : +596 696 35 98 66.","tags":["Culture","Dance"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/bele-wout","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":88,"name":"Caminagua Step Paddle","type":"activity","lat":14.502324,"lng":-61.084027,"location":"Les Anses-d’Arlet","description":"A stand-up paddle provider. Confirm rental or guided-session options and the launch point. Listed address: Plage de Grande Anse, 97217. Contact: +596 696 94 60 70. The map shows the directory’s contact point; confirm the meeting place when booking.","description_fr":"Un prestataire de stand-up paddle. Confirmez les formules de location ou d’accompagnement et le lieu de mise à l’eau. Adresse indiquée : Plage de Grande Anse, 97217. Contact : +596 696 94 60 70. La carte reprend le point de contact de l’annuaire ; confirmez le rendez-vous à la réservation.","tags":["Paddle"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/caminagua-step-paddle","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":89,"name":"Centre De Decouverte Des Sciences De La Terre","type":"activity","lat":14.754911,"lng":-61.178967,"location":"Saint-Pierre","description":"A science and interpretation centre in Saint-Pierre exploring volcanoes, natural hazards and the 1902 eruption. Listed address: Habitation Perinelle, Saint Pierre, 97250. Contact: +596 596 52 82 42.","description_fr":"Un centre scientifique et d’interprétation à Saint-Pierre, consacré aux volcans, aux risques naturels et à l’éruption de 1902. Adresse indiquée : Habitation Perinelle, Saint Pierre, 97250. Contact : +596 596 52 82 42.","tags":["Museum","Culture"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/centre-de-decouverte-des-sciences-de-la-terre","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":90,"name":"Centre D’interprétation Du Patrimoine Paul Gauguin","type":"activity","lat":14.72853017,"lng":-61.1798181,"location":"Le Carbet","description":"An interpretation centre at Anse Turin exploring Paul Gauguin’s stay in Martinique and its influence on his work. Listed address: Anse Turin, 97221. Contact: +596 596 51 53 13.","description_fr":"Un centre d’interprétation à l’Anse Turin, consacré au séjour de Paul Gauguin en Martinique et à son influence sur son œuvre. Adresse indiquée : Anse Turin, 97221. Contact : +596 596 51 53 13.","tags":["Museum","Culture"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/centre-dinterpretation-du-patrimoine-paul-gauguin","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":91,"name":"Chocolaterie Les Freres Lauzea","type":"activity","lat":14.6228866,"lng":-60.989974,"location":"Le Lamentin","description":"A chocolate and confectionery shop highlighting cacao, tropical fruit and Martinique flavours. Listed address: Immeuble Bois Carré, 97232. Contact: +596 596 50 50 18.","description_fr":"Une chocolaterie-confiserie mettant en avant le cacao, les fruits tropicaux et les saveurs martiniquaises. Adresse indiquée : Immeuble Bois Carré, 97232. Contact : +596 596 50 50 18.","tags":["Chocolate","Tasting"],"sources":[{"url":"https://w