uction ou dégustations accessibles. Adresse indiquée : USINE DE SAINTE MARIE, 97230. Contact : +596 596 69 30 02.","tags":["Rum Tasting","History","Garden"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-st-james","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":99,"name":"Distillerie Trois Rivieres","type":"activity","lat":14.4798345,"lng":-60.9636464,"location":"Sainte-Luce","description":"Visit the former distillery site and its recognisable windmill. Rum production has moved elsewhere; check available tours and tastings. Listed address: Quartier Trois-Rivières, 97228. Contact: +596 596 62 51 78.","description_fr":"Découvrez le site de l’ancienne distillerie et son moulin caractéristique. La production a été déplacée ; vérifiez les visites et dégustations proposées. Adresse indiquée : Quartier Trois-Rivières, 97228. Contact : +596 596 62 51 78.","tags":["Rum Tasting","History","Garden"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/distillerie-trois-rivieres","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":100,"name":"Explore Martinique (Tété Dwèt)","type":"activity","lat":14.6033332,"lng":-61.046196,"location":"Fort-de-France","description":"Food-focused guided experiences introducing the flavours and culture of Fort-de-France. Listed address: Batiment 3000, Zone Franche de Dillon, 97224.","description_fr":"Des expériences guidées autour de la cuisine pour découvrir les saveurs et la culture de Fort-de-France. Adresse indiquée : Batiment 3000, Zone Franche de Dillon, 97224.","tags":["Tasting","Local Produce"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/explore-martinique-tete-dwet","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":101,"name":"Flags","type":"activity","lat":14.7430041,"lng":-61.17598,"location":"Saint-Pierre","description":"An outdoor work by Laurent Valère representing large bois-lélé forms, inspired by a traditional kitchen utensil. Listed address: Rue Victor Hugo, 97250.","description_fr":"Une œuvre extérieure de Laurent Valère représentant de grands bois-lélé, inspirés d’un ustensile traditionnel de cuisine. Adresse indiquée : Rue Victor Hugo, 97250.","tags":["Art"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/flags","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":102,"name":"Fort Saint Louis","type":"activity","lat":14.6035245,"lng":-61.069714,"location":"Fort-de-France","description":"A historic fort overlooking Fort-de-France bay. Consult the visitor service about guided tours and permitted access. Listed address: Bd CHEVALIER SAINTE MARTHE, 97200.","description_fr":"Un fort historique dominant la baie de Fort-de-France. Consultez le service des visites pour les visites guidées et les accès autorisés. Adresse indiquée : Bd CHEVALIER SAINTE MARTHE, 97200.","tags":["Heritage","History"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/fort-saint-louis","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":103,"name":"An Griyav-La","type":"activity","lat":14.6769019,"lng":-60.9452794,"location":"Le Robert","description":"An agricultural visitor site at Moulin à Vent, with guava orchards, other crops and farm animals. Listed address: Quartier moulin à vent, 97231. Contact: +596 596 65 21 17.","description_fr":"Un site agrotouristique au quartier Moulin à Vent, avec vergers de goyaviers, autres cultures et animaux de ferme. Adresse indiquée : Quartier moulin à vent, 97231. Contact : +596 596 65 21 17.","tags":["Tasting","Local Produce"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/griyav-la","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":104,"name":"Habdaphai","type":"activity","lat":14.4550238,"lng":-60.903451,"location":"Le Marin","description":"Discover the visual-art world of Habdaphaï, with works drawing on masks, symbols and island life. Visits should be arranged. Listed address: Port de Plaisance, 97290. Contact: +596 696 48 88 62.","description_fr":"Découvrez l’univers plastique d’Habdaphaï, autour des masques, des symboles et de la vie insulaire. Les visites sont à organiser à l’avance. Adresse indiquée : Port de Plaisance, 97290. Contact : +596 696 48 88 62.","tags":["Art","Culture"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/habdaphai","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":105,"name":"Habitation La Salle","type":"activity","lat":14.641528,"lng":-61.024174,"location":"Sainte-Marie","description":"A site connected to Martinique’s cultural and historical heritage. Listed address: RD24, Case Jules, 97230. Contact: +596 596 62 50 74.","description_fr":"Un site lié au patrimoine culturel et historique martiniquais. Adresse indiquée : RD24, Case Jules, 97230. Contact : +596 596 62 50 74.","tags":["Heritage","History"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/habitation-la-salle","title":"Comité Martiniquais d