3669,"lng":-61.1763756,"location":"Saint-Pierre","description":"The covered market on Place Bertin in Saint-Pierre, combining local trading activity with the town’s rebuilt heritage. Listed address: Rue Bouillé, 97250. Contact: +596 696 17 64 34.","description_fr":"Le marché couvert de la place Bertin à Saint-Pierre, associant commerce local et patrimoine de la ville reconstruite. Adresse indiquée : Rue Bouillé, 97250. Contact : +596 696 17 64 34.","tags":["Heritage","History"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-marche-couvert","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":114,"name":"Le Monde Des Epices / Bénédicte Chocolats","type":"activity","lat":14.5972224,"lng":-60.994398,"location":"Le Lamentin","description":"A local food and flavour discovery address. Check the current visitor and tasting arrangements. Listed address: 4 ZAC Lareinty, 97232.","description_fr":"Une adresse pour découvrir des produits et saveurs. Vérifiez les modalités actuelles de visite et de dégustation. Adresse indiquée : 4 ZAC Lareinty, 97232.","tags":["Tasting","Chocolate"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/culture-patrimoine/le-monde-des-epices-benedicte-chocolats","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":115,"name":"Le Petit Train De Belfort","type":"activity","lat":14.6502749,"lng":-60.996664,"location":"Le Lamentin","description":"A small-train experience on a banana-growing estate in Le Lamentin, introducing the crop and its production. Listed address: Quartier Belfort, 97232. Contact: +596 696 25 25 89.","description_fr":"Une découverte en petit train d’une exploitation bananière au Lamentin, pour comprendre la culture et la