ism listing notes slippery terrain in wet weather. Listed address: Fond lahayé, 97233.","description_fr":"Une balade à pied vers la cascade An Ba So. La fiche touristique signale un terrain glissant par temps de pluie. Adresse indiquée : Fond lahayé, 97233.","tags":["Hiking","Waterfall"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/cascadean-ba-so","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":157,"name":"Comité De La Randonnée Pédestre De La Martinique","type":"activity","lat":14.60323255,"lng":-61.0698157,"location":"Fort-de-France","description":"An organiser of guided walks and hikes in Martinique. Confirm the route, difficulty and meeting point directly. Listed address: Comité de la Randonnée Pédestre de la Martinique, 97200. Contact: +596 596 70 54 88. The map shows the directory’s contact point; confirm the meeting place when booking.","description_fr":"Un organisateur de promenades et randonnées accompagnées en Martinique. Confirmez directement le parcours, la difficulté et le rendez-vous. Adresse indiquée : Comité de la Randonnée Pédestre de la Martinique, 97200. Contact : +596 596 70 54 88. La carte reprend le point de contact de l’annuaire ; confirmez le rendez-vous à la réservation.","tags":["Hiking","Guided Tour"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/comite-de-la-randonnee-pedestre-de-la-martinique","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":158,"name":"Corps De Garde","type":"activity","lat":14.4665878,"lng":-60.945547,"location":"Sainte-Luce","description":"A beach west of Sainte-Luce with a shaded shoreline and nautical activity nearby. Check current sea conditions and local access notices.","description_fr":"Une plage à l’ouest de Sainte-Luce, avec un rivage ombragé et des activités nautiques à proximité. Vérifiez l’état de la mer et les consignes locales d’accès.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/corps-de-garde","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":159,"name":"Etang Des Salines","type":"activity","lat":14.4062185,"lng":-60.868201,"location":"Sainte-Anne","description":"A coastal lagoon behind the Salines beach, offering a different view of the area’s wetland landscape.","description_fr":"Une lagune littorale derrière la plage des Salines, pour découvrir les paysages de zone humide du secteur.","tags":["Wetland","Nature"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/etang-des-salines","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":160,"name":"Fond Banane","type":"activity","lat":14.4658346,"lng":-60.942102,"location":"Sainte-Luce","description":"A small tree-lined beach between the village of Sainte-Luce and Trois-Rivières. Check current sea conditions and local access notices.","description_fr":"Une petite plage arborée entre le bourg de Sainte-Luce et Trois-Rivières. Vérifiez l’état de la mer et les consignes locales d’accès.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/fond-banane","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":161,"name":"Foret De Montravail","type":"activity","lat":14.4908378,"lng":-60.9481887,"location":"Sainte-Luce","description":"A forest recreation area above Sainte-Luce with tropical woodland and walking opportunities. Listed address: Quartier l''Epinay, 97228. Contact: +596 596 60 70 70.","description_fr":"Un espace forestier sur les hauteurs de Sainte-Luce, avec forêt tropicale et possibilités de promenade. Adresse indiquée : Quartier l''Epinay, 97228. Contact : +596 596 60 70 70.","tags":["Forest","Nature"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/foret-de-montravail","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":162,"name":"Foret Vatable","type":"activity","lat":14.5361048,"lng":-61.019956,"location":"Les Trois-Îlets","description":"A coastal woodland site near the Village de la Poterie, overlooking the bay and mangrove landscapes. Listed address: Quartier Vatable, 97229.","description_fr":"Un site boisé du littoral près du Village de la Poterie, donnant sur la baie et les paysages de mangrove. Adresse indiquée : Quartier Vatable, 97229.","tags":["Forest","Nature"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/foret-vatable","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":163,"name":"Grande Anse D''arlet","type":"activity","lat":14.5062167,"lng":-61.087793,"location":"Les Anses-d’Arlet","description":"A bay and beach at Les Anses-d’Arlet, with boats at anchor and restaurants along the shore. Check current sea conditions and local access notices.","description_fr":"Une baie et une plage aux Anses-d’Arlet, avec des bateaux au mouillage et des restaurants sur le rivage. Vérifiez l’état de la mer et les consignes locales d’accès.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/grande-anse-darlet","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":164,"name":"Gros Raisin","type":"activity","lat":14.4658606,"lng":-60.925591,"location":"Sainte-Luce","description":"A beach close to the centre of Sainte-Luce, with picnic areas and nearby food outlets. Check current sea conditions and local access notices.","description_fr":"Une plage proche du centre de Sainte-Luce, avec des espaces de pique-nique et des points de restauration voisins. Vérifiez l’état de la mer et les consignes locales d’accès.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/gros-raisin","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":165,"name":"Jardin Atoumo","type":"activity","lat":14.6090068,"lng":-61.046135,"location":"Fort-de-France","description":"A garden in Dillon introducing local and medicinal plants. Check visitor arrangements with the organiser. Listed address: Rue Kann Ribanne, 97200. Contact: +596 596 03 84 03.","description_fr":"Un jardin à Dillon pour découvrir les plantes locales et médicinales. Vérifiez les modalités de visite auprès de l’organisateur. Adresse indiquée : Rue Kann Ribanne, 97200. Contact : +596 596 03 84 03.","tags":["Garden","Nature"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/jardin-atoumo","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":166,"name":"La Breche","type":"activity","lat":14.7676405,"lng":-60.91087,"location":"La Trinité","description":"A beach just east of Tartane on the road towards the end of the Caravelle peninsula. Check current sea conditions and local access notices.","description_fr":"Une plage à l’est du bourg de Tartane, sur la route vers l’extrémité de la presqu’île de la Caravelle. Vérifiez l’état de la mer et les consignes locales d’accès.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/la-breche","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":167,"name":"Lakou A","type":"activity","lat":14.7285769,"lng":-61.0122,"location":"Gros-Morne","description":"An agricultural and cultural visitor space at Gros-Morne, bringing together growing, local flavours and traditions. Listed address: Bois Lezard, 97213. Contact: +596 696 17 34 74.","description_fr":"Un espace de visite agricole et culturel au Gros-Morne, associant cultures, saveurs locales et traditions. Adresse indiquée : Bois Lezard, 97213. Contact : +596 696 17 34 74.","tags":["Garden","Nature"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/lakou","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":168,"name":"Le Domaine De La Vallée","type":"activity","lat":14.78486693,"lng":-61.1440236,"location":"Le Morne-Rouge","description":"A garden or agricultural visitor site introducing tropical plants and local landscapes. Listed address: Habitation mespont, 97260. Contact: +596 596 52 51 81.","description_fr":"Un jardin ou site agricole de visite pour découvrir les plantes tropicales et les paysages locaux. Adresse indiquée : Habitation mespont, 97260. Contact : +596 596 52 51 81.","tags":["Garden","Nature"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/le-domaine-de-la-vallee","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":169,"name":"Le Domaine D’émeraude","type":"activity","lat":14.7495148,"lng":-61.101802,"location":"Le Morne-Rouge","description":"A nature interpretation site at Le Morne-Rouge, with forest paths and displays about Martinique’s biodiversity. Contact: +596 596 52 33 49.","description_fr":"Un site d’interprétation de la nature au Morne-Rouge, avec sentiers forestiers et présentation de la biodiversité martiniquaise. Contact : +596 596 52 33 49.","tags":["Garden","Nature"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/le-domaine-demeraude","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Telephone"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":170,"name":"Le Trou Caraibe","type":"activity","lat":14.73134788,"lng":-61.1786434,"location":"Le Carbet","description":"A historic passage cut through a coastal rock near Le Carbet, linked to the old route towards Saint-Pierre. Listed address: ANSE TURIN, 97221.","description_fr":"Un passage historique creusé dans un rocher du littoral près du Carbet, lié à l’ancienne liaison vers Saint-Pierre. Adresse indiquée : ANSE TURIN, 97221.","tags":["Heritage"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/le-trou-caraibe","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":171,"name":"Les Jardins De Denel","type":"activity","lat":14.71880808,"lng":-60.9939699,"location":"Gros-Morne","description":"A visitor experience connected to Denel, introducing tropical fruit and local agricultural production. Listed address: USINE ROYAL, 97213. Contact: +596 596 67 97 83.","description_fr":"Une expérience de visite liée à Denel, pour découvrir les fruits tropicaux et la production agricole locale. Adresse indiquée : USINE ROYAL, 97213. Contact : +596 596 67 97 83.","tags":["Garden","Nature"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/les-jardins-de-denel","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":172,"name":"Les Pitons Du Carbet","type":"activity","lat":14.7052194,"lng":-61.134494,"location":"Le Carbet","description":"A mountain landscape in northern Martinique. The map marks the massif, not a verified trailhead; arrange a suitable route with a qualified guide. Listed address: MORNE VERT, 97224.","description_fr":"Un massif montagneux du nord de la Martinique. La carte indique le massif, et non un départ de sentier vérifié ; préparez un itinéraire adapté avec un guide qualifié. Adresse indiquée : MORNE VERT, 97224.","tags":["Mountain","Nature"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/les-pitons-du-carbet","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":173,"name":"L''îlet Sainte Marie Et Son Tombolo","type":"activity","lat":14.7877642,"lng":-60.989287,"location":"Sainte-Marie","description":"A seasonal sand connection between Sainte-Marie and its islet. Access depends on sea conditions and local instructions. The tourism source warns that swimming is dangerous and unsupervised. Contact: +596 596 58 69 98.","description_fr":"Une liaison sableuse saisonnière entre Sainte-Marie et son îlet. L’accès dépend de la mer et des consignes locales. La source touristique signale une baignade dangereuse et non surveillée. Contact : +596 596 58 69 98.","tags":["Natural Site"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/lilet-sainte-marie-et-son-tombolo","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Telephone"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":174,"name":"An Mao Héritage","type":"activity","lat":14.4716982,"lng":-60.890943,"location":"Le Marin","description":"A garden and memorial site exploring local history, plants and the legacy of Martinique’s ancestors. Listed address: Morne Gommier, 97290. Contact: +596 596 74 06 04.","description_fr":"Un jardin et lieu de mémoire consacré à l’histoire locale, aux plantes et à l’héritage des ancêtres martiniquais. Adresse indiquée : Morne Gommier, 97290. Contact : +596 596 74 06 04.","tags":["Heritage","Garden"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/mao-heritage","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":175,"name":"Plage De Bateliere","type":"activity","lat":14.6050502,"lng":-61.096073,"location":"Schœlcher","description":"A beach in the Batelière area of Schœlcher, with dining and diving activities nearby. Listed address: Hôtel Batelière, 97233. Check current sea conditions and local access notices.","description_fr":"Une plage dans le secteur de la Batelière à Schœlcher, avec restauration et plongée à proximité. Adresse indiquée : Hôtel Batelière, 97233. Vérifiez l’état de la mer et les consignes locales d’accès.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/plage-de-bateliere","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":176,"name":"Plage De Cosmy","type":"activity","lat":14.7507502,"lng":-60.966145,"location":"La Trinité","description":"A beach north of the town of La Trinité, with a shaded shoreline setting. Check current sea conditions and local access notices.","description_fr":"Une plage au nord du bourg de La Trinité, dans un cadre de rivage ombragé. Vérifiez l’état de la mer et les consignes locales d’accès.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/plage-de-cosmy","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":177,"name":"Plage De Dizac","type":"activity","lat":14.4776073,"lng":-61.026186,"location":"Le Diamant","description":"The long beach of Le Diamant, facing the offshore rock. Enjoy the landscape and check local sea-condition notices before entering the water. Check current sea conditions and local access notices.","description_fr":"La longue plage du Diamant, face au rocher. Profitez du paysage et consultez les consignes locales sur l’état de la mer avant d’entrer dans l’eau. Vérifiez l’état de la mer et les consignes locales d’accès.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/plage-de-dizac","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":178,"name":"Plage Pointe La Rose","type":"activity","lat":14.6508809,"lng":-60.889864,"location":"Le Robert","description":"A small sand-and-pebble shoreline near Pointe La Rose. The tourism listing describes difficult access; confirm the route locally. Check current sea conditions and local access notices.","description_fr":"Un petit rivage de sable et de galets près de la Pointe La Rose. La fiche touristique décrit un accès difficile ; confirmez le chemin sur place. Vérifiez l’état de la mer et les consignes locales d’accès.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/plage-pointe-la-rose","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":179,"name":"Point De Vue Du Morne Gommier - Vision Panoramique À 360°","type":"activity","lat":14.4752916,"lng":-60.865976,"location":"Le Marin","description":"A hilltop viewpoint above Le Marin with a panorama over the south of Martinique. Confirm visitor arrangements directly. Listed address: Le Morne Gommier, 97290. Contact: +596 596 74 25 01.","description_fr":"Un point de vue sur les hauteurs du Marin, avec un panorama sur le sud de la Martinique. Confirmez directement les modalités de visite. Adresse indiquée : Le Morne Gommier, 97290. Contact : +596 596 74 25 01.","tags":["Viewpoint"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/point-de-vue-du-morne-gommier-vision-panoramique-360deg","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":180,"name":"Pointe Faula","type":"activity","lat":14.5429045,"lng":-60.826626,"location":"Le Vauclin","description":"A lagoon-side beach in Le Vauclin, associated with wind-powered water sports. Check current sea conditions and local access notices.","description_fr":"Une plage en bord de lagon au Vauclin, associée aux sports nautiques de glisse. Vérifiez l’état de la mer et les consignes locales d’accès.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/pointe-faula","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":181,"name":"Pointe Marin","type":"activity","lat":14.4427105,"lng":-60.881591,"location":"Sainte-Anne","description":"A long beach near the entrance to Sainte-Anne, with coconut palms and water-based leisure nearby. Check current sea conditions and local access notices.","description_fr":"Une longue plage près de l’entrée de Sainte-Anne, avec cocotiers et loisirs nautiques à proximité. Vérifiez l’état de la mer et les consignes locales d’accès.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/pointe-marin","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":182,"name":"Pont Cafe","type":"activity","lat":14.4649256,"lng":-60.938829,"location":"Sainte-Luce","description":"A small shaded beach on the Sainte-Luce coast near a nautical activity base. Check current sea conditions and local access notices.","description_fr":"Une petite plage ombragée du littoral de Sainte-Luce, près d’une base d’activités nautiques. Vérifiez l’état de la mer et les consignes locales d’accès.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/pont-cafe","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":183,"name":"Tartane","type":"activity","lat":14.7606492,"lng":-60.915961,"location":"La Trinité","description":"The village beach of Tartane, with fishing boats and a view across the bay. Check current sea conditions and local access notices.","description_fr":"La plage du bourg de Tartane, avec des bateaux de pêche et une vue sur la baie. Vérifiez l’état de la mer et les consignes locales d’accès.","tags":["Beach"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/tartane","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":184,"name":"Vanille Volkanik","type":"activity","lat":14.76622365,"lng":-61.1153259,"location":"Le Morne-Rouge","description":"A tropical farm at Le Morne-Rouge offering a discovery of vanilla growing.","description_fr":"Une exploitation tropicale au Morne-Rouge proposant une découverte de la culture de la vanille.","tags":["Farm Visit","Vanilla"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/vanille-volkanik","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":185,"name":"Zoo De Martinique-Habitation Anse Latouche","type":"activity","lat":14.731364,"lng":-61.1774164,"location":"Le Carbet","description":"A zoo and landscaped garden within the historic Habitation Latouche estate in Le Carbet. Listed address: Quartier Anse la Touche, 97221. Contact: +596 596 52 76 08.","description_fr":"Un zoo et un jardin paysager dans le domaine historique de l’Habitation Latouche au Carbet. Adresse indiquée : Quartier Anse la Touche, 97221. Contact : +596 596 52 76 08.","tags":["Zoo","Garden"],"sources":[{"url":"https://www.martinique.org/fr/que-faire/sites-naturels-publics/zoo-de-martinique-habitation-anse-latouche","title":"Comité Martiniquais du Tourisme","fields":["Name","Town","Category","Description","Map point","Address","Telephone"],"checkedAt":"2026-09-24"}],"access":"unknown","published":true},{"id":186,"name":"Abaca Dive  -  Espace Plongée Martinique","type":"activity","lat":14.55909536,"lng":-61.0513084,"location":"Les Trois-Îlets","description":"A diving provider listed in the local tourism directory. Ask about introductory sessions, exploration dives and training suited to your experience. Listed address: Marina de la pointe du bout, 97229. Contact: +596 596 66 01 79. The map shows the directory’s contact point; confirm the meeting place when booking.","description_fr":"Un prestataire de plongée répertorié par l’office de tourisme. Renseignez-vous sur les baptêmes, explorations et formations adaptés à votre expérience. A